.TH PSVectorWrite 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSVectorWrite

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/maths.h>

.I
void  
.br
\fBPSVectorWrite\fR(\fIPSFloat *vec\fR, \fIuint64_t len\fR, \fIchar* sep\fR, \fIFILE *f\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a string representation of vector \fIvec\fR having length of \fIlen\fR to the file stream \fIf\fR.
.br
The optional \fIsep\fR argument can be used to specify a separator string for vector's values (if \fIsep\fR is null, by default "," is used as separator).
.br
If \fIvec\fR is null or \fIf\fR is null, the function will immediately return.
